# Keep host build output out of the build context: COPY . . would otherwise drop Windows-path
# project.assets.json and stale binaries on top of the restore done inside the image.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
portal/dist/
**/TestResults/
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal

.git/
.github/
.vs/
.idea/
.superpowers/
*.user
